{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mind Inc.</strong>, where restoring memories is just a game. Step into people\u2019s minds, explore their labyrinths, and help them rediscover the moments they\u2019ve forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Mental Labyrinths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each client\u2019s mind takes the shape of a grid-based labyrinth. Navigate twisting passages, find hidden paths, and make your way deeper into the maze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Unique Tasks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every person\u2019s mind has its own quirks. From unlocking doors and assembling keys to bringing teacups to a table, each level introduces a simple but unique challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Puzzle Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the labyrinth are fragments of memory. Pick them up, carry them out, and prepare to restore what\u2019s been lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the pieces to the puzzle room and fit them together. When complete, each puzzle reveals a beautifully illustrated memory \u2014 heartfelt drawings of real moments worth remembering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based labyrinth exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique tasks for every person\u2019s mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry, organize, and deliver puzzle pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 illustrated memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, short, and meaningful play experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797990?t=1767175538","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797990?t=1767175538","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797990/a4eafa13e596cd61d6e9013b6a4f649c90884329/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767175538","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797990/a4eafa13e596cd61d6e9013b6a4f649c90884329/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767175538","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4025300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mind Inc.</strong>, where restoring memories is just a game. Step into people\u2019s minds, explore their labyrinths, and help them rediscover the moments they\u2019ve forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Mental Labyrinths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each client\u2019s mind takes the shape of a grid-based labyrinth. Navigate twisting passages, find hidden paths, and make your way deeper into the maze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Unique Tasks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every person\u2019s mind has its own quirks. From unlocking doors and assembling keys to bringing teacups to a table, each level introduces a simple but unique challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Puzzle Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the labyrinth are fragments of memory. Pick them up, carry them out, and prepare to restore what\u2019s been lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the pieces to the puzzle room and fit them together. When complete, each puzzle reveals a beautifully illustrated memory \u2014 heartfelt drawings of real moments worth remembering.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based labyrinth exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique tasks for every person\u2019s mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry, organize, and deliver puzzle pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 illustrated memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, short, and meaningful play experience</p></li></ul>","developers":["Two Blackbirds"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797990/4fbc952b34cf7dda6fd7ea6d26cbd4c4638c2c4c/header.jpg?t=1767175538","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797990/2119982554/9364e1223c738911a52016c036cc689fb11e1bff/1766401029/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766401929","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797990/2119982554/9364e1223c738911a52016c036cc689fb11e1bff/1766401029/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766401929","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797990/2119982554/9364e1223c738911a52016c036cc689fb11e1bff/1766401029/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766401929","id":257253979,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257253979/505ec6e30c19d29399599b3029e36d89e968eeb6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766401929"}],"name":"Mind Inc","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+) and Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Two Blackbirds"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"ba